learn by studying the living Earth itself.

7
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:25,440
And hey, just a quick reminder as we walk, we're here as stewards of tradition and

8
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:27,200
education, right?

9
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:28,520
Absolutely never for medical advice.

10
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,800
Let's uncover some green magic.

11
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:34,240
Go ahead and step gently through this rusted riddle gate.

12
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:37,120
You can really feel the contrast here, can't you?

13
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:41,320
We are leaving your digital shipwreck behind, just turning away from those cold

14
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:45,760
screens and walking into a living, breathing apothecary.

15
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:49,840
This gate right here is where the rigid data structures of our modern lives start

16
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:54,320
to tangle up with roots, vines, and glitch mycelium.

17
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:57,960
You're stepping into a sanctuary that's quite literally designed to heal the

18
00:00:57,960 --> 00:01:00,360
digital exhaustion of our age.

19
00:01:00,360 --> 00:01:06,160
Now, the deepest truth of our work here, it's actually written right on the walls.

20
00:01:06,160 --> 00:01:09,520
We're wandering beneath a 13-hour clock, but don't worry,

21
00:01:09,520 --> 00:01:12,720
