85
00:05:02,420 --> 00:05:04,840
The Minotaur here is simple but absolute.

86
00:05:04,840 --> 00:05:08,080
We have to remember this magic is for the skin only.

87
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:11,620
It is strictly, entirely limited to external use.

88
00:05:11,620 --> 00:05:13,200
No eating this one.

89
00:05:13,200 --> 00:05:18,580
The seventh hour glows so brightly with wild daga, affectionately called lion's tail.

90
00:05:18,580 --> 00:05:23,480
You can always spot it by those vibrant orange spires that reliably call sunbirds right down

91
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:24,480
