92
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:28,720
It's traditionally brewed but with immense care, and that care is necessary because our

93
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:31,820
guardian Minotaur warns against harvesting the wrong pieces.

94
00:05:31,820 --> 00:05:36,200
We must be absolutely certain to use only the specific, safe parts of the plant, avoiding

95
00:05:36,200 --> 00:05:39,560
any toxic components that might be hidden elsewhere in its structure.

96
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:43,380
Well, we're more than halfway through our clock now, and we need to pause.

97
00:05:43,380 --> 00:05:48,500
Let's step into this sacred grove within the labyrinth, just to remember our duty.

98
00:05:48,500 --> 00:05:53,400
As stewards of this wild pharmacy, we aren't mere consumers, we're protectors.

99
00:05:53,400 --> 00:05:56,200
We're facing the endangered healers now.

100
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:58,520
Our mantra here is absolutely vital.

101
00:05:58,520 --> 00:06:01,040
Take the leaf, spare the bark.

102
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:04,520
We have to actively grow back the plants that have been loved to near death by the

103
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:05,520
