104
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:09,400
Guided by that very mantra, our eight brings us to pepper bark.

105
00:06:09,400 --> 00:06:13,400
This is an incredibly potent but severely endangered tree.

106
00:06:13,400 --> 00:06:16,920
Because of this, we only ever work with cultivated botanicals.

107
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:21,000
When we harvest, we take only the leaf for our extractions, and we completely spare the

108
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:23,680
