109
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:26,000
The Minotaur here is extinction itself.

110
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:30,800
We defeat it by demanding strict, unyielding conservation practices.

111
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:34,080
Our ninth hour, unearth's African wild ginger.

112
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:37,840
This is another highly sought after, rare root that carries incredible warmth and a

113
00:06:37,840 --> 00:06:40,120
