114
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:43,760
But, because the medicine is in the root, pulling it takes a life.

115
00:06:43,760 --> 00:06:48,600
Therefore, we have to actively cultivate it ourselves and extract it very sparingly.

116
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:53,560
The fierce minotaur of over-harvesting lives here, and we ward it off with profound respect,

117
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:56,120
