118
00:06:56,120 --> 00:07:00,560
For the tenth hour, we get to step back into the light to greet an old friend.

119
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:03,480
Rosemary is our easy-grow gold standard.

120
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:08,280
We harvest the fragrant sprigs, which are historically reputed to aid mental clarity and

121
