122
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:12,800
It's wonderfully resilient.

123
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:16,120
Yet, even familiar friends have boundaries, right?

124
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:19,380
The minotaur here is the hazard of overindulgence.

125
00:07:19,380 --> 00:07:25,080
We must avoid excessive concentration to keep the remedy helpful rather than harmful.

126
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:29,440
Our eleven creeps quietly along the damp edges of our path.

127
00:07:29,440 --> 00:07:35,160
This is Gotu Kola, a low-lying botanical gathered and concocted to support traditional vitality

128
00:07:35,160 --> 00:07:37,320
