It's closely guarded by a minotaur of dangerous lookalikes that share its creeping habit.

131
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:50,920
We have to observe the leaves so closely, wisely warding off the imposters before bringing

132
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:53,280
