133
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:58,720
The twelfth hour brings us a heavy-hitter, Palarga Nome, traditionally known as Amkalabo.

134
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:03,600
The dark roots of this plant are historically extracted to provide robust immunity support,

135
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:06,240
