139
00:08:14,900 --> 00:08:18,720
In this part of the garden, shortcuts simply will not do.

140
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:22,160
At last, the shadow of the thirteenth hour arrives.

141
00:08:22,160 --> 00:08:25,760
Here we meet the intensely bitter wormwood, or wild owls.

142
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:30,280
This is a plant of deep magic where reading the sky and timing the leaf harvest perfectly

143
00:08:30,280 --> 00:08:32,280
