144
00:08:32,280 --> 00:08:38,520
It's a sharp, potent finish to our walk, guarded by a fierce minotaur of thujun toxicity.

145
00:08:38,520 --> 00:08:43,460
We navigate this final hazard by strictly limiting our doses, fully respecting the profound

146
00:08:43,460 --> 00:08:45,700
strength held in its bitter leaves.

147
00:08:45,700 --> 00:08:50,160
And so, having walked the full thirteen hours, we finally arrive at the cauldron at the

148
00:08:50,160 --> 00:08:52,200
