149
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:53,200
Think about it.

150
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:56,480
You can get here by simply following a digital map on a screen.

151
00:08:56,480 --> 00:09:01,280
You've found your way by studying the living plants, by learning their names, their parts,

152
00:09:01,280 --> 00:09:03,960
