153
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:07,960
You've mastered the basics of the apothecary simply by engaging directly with the earth.

154
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:13,320
I want to leave you with this final, gentle provocation as we close our explainer today.

155
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:15,320
The pharmacy you've been looking for?

156
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:18,000
It's already planted right beneath your feet.

157
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:20,120
You're no longer just a consumer.

158
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:23,120
You are a steward of a living ecosystem.

159
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:28,280
So as you leave this labyrinth and return to your own soil, ask yourself, if your kitchen

